      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEPUNGA PHANTOM (5) has a big motor and ideally suited at the longer trips. Was too tough when scoring last time over 595m at Sandown in a Grade 4/5 (34.37). Form at the trip excellent including four wins. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Has put together a string of wins and expected to go close again. BRINDLE SURPRISE (4) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish second (34.81) at this track in a Mix 3/4 over 600m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can measure up. ELITE ONE (1) goes very well at the course and distance with three wins and a placing from six starts. Hit the frame latest (30.29) when second at this track in a Free For All. Looks a key chance on best figures. MAGIC LOKI (7) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish here at this distance.",
